WEBVTT

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:08.550
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:15.060
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.890
It's my day!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.470
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.880
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:42.250
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:49.660
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:55.430
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.570
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:10.080
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:16.220
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:19.290
I just want to walk

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:22.830
Not on tip-toe

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.800
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:35.700
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:42.140
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:44.410
It's my day!

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:13.170
Wh-what's with you?

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:15.910
When did you get back?

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:17.640
I just arrived last night.

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:19.720
You could've at least called.

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:22.690
I wanted to surprise you all.

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:29.560
Oh... long time no see.

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:34.870
How'd your face get messed up?

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:41.770
Wel... wel...

00:02:43.070 --> 00:02:43.970
Welcome...

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:46.940
...home.

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:58.480
Rui, Makino and I are dating.

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:01.120
What?!

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:09.330
"Will You Go Out With Me?"

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:27.080
Hold on. I wouldn't go that far.

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:29.280
I see...

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.180
That's too bad.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:36.120
Don'cha think?

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:38.490
So back off.

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.510
You know the saying:

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:43.160
"He who meddles with another's love life
gets trampled to death by a cow."

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:45.610
Don't you mean,

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:47.230
Don't you mean "Gets kicked to death
by a horse"?

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.720
Okay, since the F4's reunited
after so long...

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.700
...let's blow off the rest of
our afternoon classes.

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.480
Bye.

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:08.370
<i>Wh-what's going on?</i>

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:11.090
<i>Too many things are
happening at once...</i>

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:13.060
<i>I can't take it all in!</i>

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:20.870
<i>Rui Hanazawa came back
from France...</i>

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.140
<i>He smiled at me...</i>

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:32.880
<i>And...</i>

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.850
<i>I love you.</i>

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:42.650
Tsukushi...

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:45.490
Thomas!

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.780
What do you want now?

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:50.630
If you're selling something,
I'm not buying.

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:53.850
Tsukushi, you've got me wrong.
Hear me out.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:56.230
I don't want to hear anything
you have to say.

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:58.500
It's about Sakurako!

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.840
Please listen to me.

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:12.850
What about Sakurako?

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:15.820
You better not be trying to trick me again.

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.230
Take a look at this photo album.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.440
It's the one she didn't want you to see...

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:24.490
when you first went to her house.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:28.940
<i>No - Don't!</i>

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.700
Now that you mention it,
I do remember that.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:41.510
Whose picture is this?

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.040
That's Sakurako.

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:47.330
It can't be. Her face...

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:52.350
It's true. That's what she really
looked like.

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:57.440
I don't understand.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.800
It happened when
we were in kindergarten...

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:15.310
<i>What? You like Domyoji?</i>

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:18.880
<i>Yeah... but it's a secret, okay?</i>

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:21.610
<i>I know. I promise not to tell anyone.</i>

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:25.550
<i>Domyoji!</i>

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:33.530
<i>Did you know that
Sakurako likes you?</i>

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:35.510
<i>No way! Good going, Tsukasa!</i>

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:37.320
<i>Where is she? Which girl?</i>

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:39.530
<i>See? She's standing over there.</i>

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:49.040
<i>Wh-what a dog! She looks nasty!</i>

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:53.080
<i>Tsukasa! Why don't you say
something to her?</i>

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:55.310
<i>You stud, you.</i>

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:58.470
<i>Or maybe he likes her, too!</i>

00:06:58.470 --> 00:06:59.560
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:03.010
<i>Hey you freak, freak, ugly freak.</i>

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:04.240
<i>Keep away from me.</i>

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:07.890
<i>You've got some nerve liking me
with that face!</i>

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:15.630
Right then, Sakurako probably
decided in her little heart...

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:19.300
that she'd become
beautiful someday. But...

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:27.540
<i>Grandmother... What have I done?</i>

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.200
<i>I thought I'd have the world
at my feet</i>

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:33.320
<i>once I became beautiful.</i>

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:38.650
<i>But now I have nothing.</i>

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:41.490
<i>Nothing but this beautiful face.</i>

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.490
<i>Not even friends...</i>

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.040
You were the first one...

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:58.670
she ever brought home from school.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:13.660
Hey! Check it out!

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:19.580
Look at this album that Yuriko brought.

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:25.700
Look. This is the true face
of Sakurako Sanjo.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.820
Whoa...

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.290
I can't believe it!

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.510
Even I wasn't able to tell...

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:38.350
...that Sakurako Sanjo had
plastic surgery done.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:41.600
She looks nothing like she did
when she was little.

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:43.580
That's so extreme.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.560
I wonder how much the
plastic surgery cost.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:52.280
Is it true that she paid for it

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:53.330
with her parents' inheritance?

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:08.510
I'm done.

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:10.940
Tsukushi, you're done already?

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.280
<i>Serves her right.</i>

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:23.090
<i>It's got nothing to do with me.</i>

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:25.120
Hey.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:28.930
That girl Sakurako was
a real freak show.

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:33.230
What're you upset about?

00:09:34.230 --> 00:09:36.220
You were the ones who're to blame.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:38.670
But I think her original face had
more character.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:42.330
Yeah. A lady should have a good face,
good personality...

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:45.060
and a nice body.
Shizuka's probably the perfect example.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:47.310
It's creepy when somebody's
too made up.

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:50.080
Long story short...

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.570
Perfect people like us are rare.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:57.540
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah...

00:09:57.540 --> 00:09:58.440
Makino.

00:09:58.440 --> 00:09:59.340
What?

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:01.490
Take this.

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:06.550
What is it?

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:09.500
You're such a pauper!

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:11.690
Don't you know what a pager is?

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:15.540
It displays a text message...

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:18.340
so when I page you,
come right away. Got it?

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:20.510
Hey...

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.520
H-hold on...

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:27.420
Got it?

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:38.460
<i>Could he be any more presumptuous?!</i>

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:45.970
<i>I mean, I was moved when
he rescued me...</i>

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:59.180
<i>And I got caught up in the moment
and kissed him...</i>

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.760
<i>But "come when I call"?
Like I'm his dog or something.</i>

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:15.000
<i>Can't he find a better way
to make a pass?</i>

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:24.310
Wh-what's all this?

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:28.300
What's going on with all of
this pricey furniture?

00:11:28.940 --> 00:11:31.070
Where is it all going to fit in our tiny...

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:32.580
two-bedroom apartment?

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:35.310
W-we didn't buy it.

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:38.820
Then how did you get
all this expensive furniture?

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:41.460
Tsukasa sent it over.

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:46.630
Something's beeping.

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:49.060
What is it? An alarm clock?

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:58.570
"Call this number immediately"?!

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:25.830
Hey, she called back right away.

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:27.580
Yo, it's me.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.040
<i>Don't give me that, "yo, it's me."</i>

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:32.530
What's up with all this furniture?

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:35.030
It's cluttering up our house.

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:36.980
<i>What in the worid are you thinking?!</i>

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:40.700
It's top-of-the-line furniture
from Holland, you know.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.040
Be thankful.

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:45.270
Anyway, come to Amazon
in Nishi Azabu.

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:47.140
Why should I?

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:48.450
<i>Whatever. Just come.</i>

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:52.820
<i>Now I'm mad.</i>

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:06.900
Oh, Makino's here.

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:11.670
You're late.

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:14.870
Late? What do you think I am?

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.610
Oh, this is my woman.

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:19.080
What? No way!

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:22.840
I haven't seen you on
the club circuit lately.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:24.850
So you've really got a girlfriend?

00:13:24.850 --> 00:13:26.520
Shoo. Shoo. Beat it.

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:29.290
There's no room for
you low-rent girls here.

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:31.080
What's his problem?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.430
Hey, have a seat.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.220
How much is Tsukasa paying you?

00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:36.600
And with a face like that...

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:44.440
Ouch! Stop it!

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:49.130
Hey, Domyoji!

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:51.980
What's with your 
high-and-mighty attitude?!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.920
You are so my type.

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:59.090
How about a kiss?

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:00.490
Sure.

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:07.700
No. Not a little one like that.
I want a good one.

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:09.070
Okay.

00:14:17.510 --> 00:14:21.910
Rui's changed since
he came back from France.

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:24.850
Every night, it's one chick
after another.

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:27.480
I wonder if something happened
with Shizuka?

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:30.690
I got some lipstick on you.

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:33.490
Hey.

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.710
Why are you just standing there?
Sit down.

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:39.920
No, thanks. I'm going home.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.800
Going home? You just got here.

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:45.650
I just came to tell you to take back
the furniture.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:46.700
See you.

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:48.770
Hey! Wait up!

00:14:57.840 --> 00:14:59.350
<i>What I saw just now...</i>

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.880
<i>Was that really Rui Hanazawa?</i>

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:05.320
<i>I can't believe it.</i>

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:11.590
<i>The Rui Hanazawa I know is aloof
and removed from everything.</i>

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:15.030
<i>I can't believe he kissed a girl for fun.</i>

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:20.300
<i>I'm so confused.</i>

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:23.170
<i>Too much has happened.</i>

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.870
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:30.010
<i>Should I seriously start
seeing Domyoji?</i>

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:38.950
<i>A "Go" sign.</i>

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:42.590
<i>But... but...</i>

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:49.600
<i>Rui Hanazawa is all I can think about.</i>

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:09.080
Sanjo!

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:12.320
I had no idea!

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.650
You're wearing a mask under all that?

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:19.020
I'm impressed.

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:20.990
This is what plastic surgery can do?

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.600
I was completely fooled.

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:34.040
You look totally different from
when you were a kid.

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:37.460
To think that a face that ugly
can become so pretty...

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:39.880
medical science sure has progressed.

00:16:44.180 --> 00:16:46.430
<i>I couldn't care less what happens to you.</i>

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:50.230
Oh, my. You look like
you don't care. Playing dumb?

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:52.060
Aren't you ashamed?

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:02.000
<i>Ugly, ugly, ugly dog... Funny face...</i>

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:05.970
<i>Ugly, ugly, ugly dog... Funny face...</i>

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:09.770
<i>Ugly, ugly, ugly dog... Funny face...</i>

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:13.610
<i>Ugly, ugly, ugly dog... Funny face...</i>

00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:22.090
Don't act so high and mighty
when you're really a dog!

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:27.220
So what?!

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:33.500
What's so wrong about buying beauty?

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:39.570
Look at yourselves.
You buy whatever you want with money.

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:45.940
Tell me! What's so wrong?!

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:57.620
What's up with you?

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.090
Got something else to say?

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.520
Do you want to be strung from
the rooftop too?

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:09.910
Yuriko, let's go.

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:10.930
Yeah, let's go.

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:21.810
Don't think that I've forgiven you yet.

00:18:22.610 --> 00:18:24.610
When I still think about what happened,

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:26.010
I get so mad, I could puke.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:32.230
It's just that... when I first
visited your house...

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:34.520
the tea you served was really good...

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:42.900
...and your tea was so warm...

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:57.080
I'm sorry.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:18:59.880
I'm sorry.

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:02.720
I'm sorry.

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:07.060
<i>That's the only reason
why I defended you.</i>

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:16.300
<i>I feel warmth against my back.</i>

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:29.440
<i>I still can't get myself to forgive her...</i>

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:31.280
<i>but...</i>

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:35.610
<i>Everyone has their own circumstances...</i>

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:39.150
<i>and they're dealing with them, I guess.</i>

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:47.490
Hello.

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.700
H-hello.

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:59.780
<i>Whoa. He's never said hello
to me before.</i>

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:02.040
Come here.

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:03.740
O-okay.

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:14.180
<i>Right now, he looks like
the old Rui Hanazawa.</i>

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:16.290
What?

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:20.570
H-how was France?

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:22.810
Nothing special.

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:24.570
Just dog poop all over the place.

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.080
P-poop? Of dogs?

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:30.470
Yeah. I got really good at dodging it
while I walked.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:36.370
It's been a while since
I've been up here.

00:20:41.310 --> 00:20:42.950
Uh... um...

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:50.460
A-about Shizuka...

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:51.990
Is it true you're dating Tsukasa?

00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:53.490
What?

00:20:55.990 --> 00:20:58.200
I-it's not like that...

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.390
I thought so.

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:03.630
I'm glad.

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:05.800
Because I had my eye on you.

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:07.140
What?!

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:09.630
Why don't you forget Tsukasa...

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:11.110
and go out with me?

00:22:05.730 --> 00:22:11.800
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:19.670
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:29.550
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:37.590
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.590 --> 00:22:45.360
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:53.510
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:53.510
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.510 --> 00:23:01.880
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.510 --> 00:23:01.880
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.680 --> 00:23:11.660
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:19.430
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.700 --> 00:23:27.600
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.700 --> 00:23:27.600
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:36.010
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:36.010
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:49.130 --> 00:23:51.460
Domyoji, who's pushy but kind.

00:23:51.730 --> 00:23:54.460
Rui Hanazawa, who's 
like a different person.

00:23:54.760 --> 00:23:59.470
Their transformations are stirring
my steady heart.

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:01.200
Next on Hana Yori Dango:

00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:03.270
"Be Still My Beating Heart"

00:24:03.510 --> 00:24:06.880
I vowed to forget Rui Hanazawa,
but those old feelings...

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:09.140
...are resurfacing.
